WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 1.1 · Strategic Foundations
Purpose

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Start from a real need, then say why you exist, not what you do.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Describe who is affected, where, and what happens.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Separate what you know from what you assume.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Keep your purpose true even if activities change.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Vanita Weavers Cooperative (Cooperative · member-owned, India)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Middlemen take most of the price. We exist so that handloom weavers in our district earn a fair living from their craft.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write the need, your evidence and your purpose.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
